WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:03.350
Queen's Blade.

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:05.670
The defeated are left with disgrace and frustration,

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:08.570
while new trials await the victors.

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:13.120
Whether they advance or turn back, these warriors will face hell.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.940
These chains of heartless battles awaken the madness within them.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:25.000
The sky will not fall, the sea will not dry, and the earth will not split.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.630
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:45.060
Just as I can see no end to this sky,

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:51.980
I inherit the will and strength that will exist forever.

00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:58.320
With each person carrying different feelings in their heart,

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:06.040
When the time comes, they will fulfill their promise with that special someone.

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:10.460
In order to become

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:15.630
the chosen ruler of this world,

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:19.720
I will shake off any pain I feel.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:26.980
The sky will not fall, the sea will not drought, and the earth will not split.

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:33.020
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:40.030
No one shall stop me on my path.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:02.100
Why did you become Aldra's dog!?

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:04.090
Dog, huh?

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:06.180
In that case, you are...

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:08.360
a stray cat.

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:08.480
I must remain calm. It's no use taking her head on.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.890
You weren't watching your back. However...

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:18.050
you have some talent, don't you?

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:20.510
If you try your best,

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:22.800
I'll make you my partner.

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:27.420
I didn't mean to do this...

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:30.270
I couldn't change your course.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:36.620
Really... to think you matured enough to be given the title of Kiba Assassin.

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:39.690
I never would have predicted that.

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:41.700
I must make this the finishing blow.

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:44.580
If I miss, I have no chance of winning!

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:47.080
That turned into a grudge.

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:51.880
Vengeance{ you say}?{revenge, retaliation}

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:55.910
My brother died as he was dragged into battle between Aldra and the nobles.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:58.700
I'll avenge him by defeating her.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:03:59.950
I'll kill Aldra with my own-

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:01.400
Leave her be.{imperative of stop / leave / quit etc}

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:02.840
You'll die before you get to her.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:06.810
But if I have the assassin techniques you've taught me...

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:09.480
Give it up.

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:13.800
You can't use something like that for your own sake.

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:32.630
What was that just now?

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:42.140
Me?

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:46.790
I see...

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:48.220
That's how it is?

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.770
If I had noticed it sooner...

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:54.480
there might have been a chance of success.

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:56.510
Now!

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:01.820
Got you!{actually she just says take or receive in past form}

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.030
Please forgive me, Irma...

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:12.690
The one who derailed your life...{drive mad, cause to malfunction, put out of order, derail}

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:16.030
was me.

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.020
Echi...

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:55.980
dna...

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:06.290
That lady just now...

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:08.110
is the strongest warrior, in a sense.

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:09.340
She's that strong?

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:13.170
She's like a demon; as one whose soul has been stolen,

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:17.100
neither fear nor pain will cause her to hesitate when faced with death.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.940
I guess we're pretty lucky, then.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:24.640
I've been meaning to ask you this, but...

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:25.440
What?

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:29.910
Why did you help me back then?

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:34.250
When Mommy was turned to stone...

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:36.660
you took pity on me, so...

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:47.900
Oh... that was only because of the Queen's bad taste. It was nothing special...

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:52.720
Thank you...

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:55.010
Airi onee-chan.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:56.990
Eh? Um...

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:58.130
Well...

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:02.560
You're very welcome.

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:08.990
What's wrong?

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:11.420
It's nothing.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:14.950
You mustn't look there!

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:21.470
I never would have expected something like this...

00:07:21.470 --> 00:07:25.500
I only have to carry out the Swamp Witch's mission...

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:28.300
That's all I need to do, and yet...!

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:44.650
I guess you don't have anything like a long life, do you?

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.420
Really...{this line is crap...}

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:05.350
That noblewoman might just be the worst possible opponent.

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:06.330
Tomoe-sama.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:08.940
Here I come.{I still don't know how to best translate this line.. here I come? ... I'll defeat you... bleh.. here I come sounds bad, it doesn't reflect here politeness}

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:10.130
You know, I...

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:15.140
really hate "good girls" like you.

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.860
"Everything I do is right."

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:20.700
That's what you think, isn't it?

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.880
T-That is not...

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:27.820
Words like "For my country" and "To avenge my friends" are lovely, but...

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:31.070
in the end, you're still harming your opponents, just like everyone else.

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:38.530
To avoid crossing blades, she's using a technique that tears her adversary's spirit to pieces.

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:42.540
Tomoe-sama's weakness.{weak point}

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:43.930
That's...

00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:47.650
Keeping such a composed expression while cutting down your enemies...

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:51.060
thinking something like "It isn't my fault!"

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:53.630
Doesn't that make <i>you</i> the one in the wrong here?

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:56.920
Y-You're mistaken, I...

00:08:56.920 --> 00:09:00.040
I have never thought anything of the sort... not even once...

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:00.980
Not even once?{again.. Never?}

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:05.130
She's honest, upright, and perhaps a bit too kind.

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:12.400
But now, if you defeat me and use me as a stepping stone, won't that accomplish your mission?

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.740
If that's the case, you don't have to hold back.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:17.330
Why don't you go ahead and stain me red with that katana?

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:25.160
How long are you going to act like a good girl?

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:31.020
Even now, you still won't let go of that attitude. You're disgusting!

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:34.570
Acting like a good girl...

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:38.510
But your sister is...

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.780
someone I consider a very close friend, and is very important to me.

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:45.000
Because of that, I would like to avoid crossing swords with you.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.260
I must admit that I am somewhat confused.

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:47.930
However...

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:48.770
Hold on...

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:51.860
What kind of relationship do you have with my sister?

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:55.080
We became intimate friends recently during our journeys.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:57.460
We also eat and sleep together.

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:58.320
Eating and sleeping?

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:01.410
Eating and sleeping?

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:11.540
T-T-T-Then you actually did <i>this</i> and <i>that</i> with my sister?

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:15.510
Unforgivable!{I wont forgive you.}

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:20.890
I'll never forgive you!

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:28.520
Unforgivable! Unforgivable! Unforgivable!{or I won't forgive you, I won't I won't! might work}

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:31.410
Was I rude in some way?

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:33.360
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!{well technically it doesn't mean shut up but you're loud / noisy or annoying}

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:37.630
I let you get away last time,
but you won't get away this time!

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:39.850
You Hinomoto mountain ape!

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:45.240
Amazing. This is the first time
I've seen Elina fight so vigorously.

00:10:46.030 --> 00:10:47.480
Tomoe-sama.

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:49.760
It looks like the tide has turned.

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:51.930
She's not even giving you a chance to defend.

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:55.580
In reality, Tomoe-sama is strong.

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:58.010
But...

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:12.380
I'm not finished!

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:28.000
I won't hand Onee-chan over to anyone!

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.920
Well done, Elina.

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:31.730
Now, do not fail in the endgame.

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:41.350
Onee-chan belongs only to me!

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:46.630
What?!

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:48.490
Warrior Shrine Maiden technique!

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:54.650
Final Three-stranded Warrior Kick!

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:14.280
I'll never hand Leina over to someone like...

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:21.120
I-I won.

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:24.610
That's as far as you could go?

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:26.740
Elina...

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:32.500
Tomoe's strength is boundless.

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:34.130
I have to try my best, too...

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:36.920
Ah, that's right! My sword!

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:39.780
Just what is Ymir doing?

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:43.730
Like I thought...

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:44.780
Something...

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:46.200
is missing!

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:56.120
Melpha, it's about{soon} time for dinner...

00:12:56.120 --> 00:13:01.010
Of course. As soon as we have completed our Holy Pose, I will start preparing it.

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:04.840
Can't we just do something like this after dinner?

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.190
That is out of the question.

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:09.960
Such extreme exercises after dinner...

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:13.370
would ruin the fruits of your labor.

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:19.440
Just what's going on? I wasn't expecting something like this!

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:24.360
Archangel-sama!

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:28.780
So the most likely winner finally makes her entrance?

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.870
So the invitation has arrived.

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:36.870
Do your best, okay, onee-chan?

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:41.060
If I can absorb my opponent's life force, then...

00:13:41.060 --> 00:13:42.860
I should be able to regain my strength.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:48.590
But if she's too strong and doesn't give me an opening...

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:49.850
Airi onee-chan?

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:53.100
I will come back right away.

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:56.140
Be a good boy and don't be too noisy.

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:59.560
Hey, I'll come along with you too.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:03.440
That privilege is reserved for your mother alone.

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:08.950
Onee-chan...

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:13.170
Shizuka-san, I've returned.

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:15.540
Shizuka-san?

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:19.520
This is...

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:25.590
Ah, damn. I should have eaten something...

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:30.010
I'm so hungry...

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:34.760
Aren't you the underworld's maid?

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:36.220
Are <i>you</i> my opponent?

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:41.120
How rude! I'm the <i>Temptress</i> of the Underworld!

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:44.570
I stand defeated.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:46.720
Aldra!

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:55.490
Since a messenger of heaven is participating with me in Queen's Blade...

00:14:55.940 --> 00:15:00.550
I must personally express my gratitude upon meeting her.

00:15:00.550 --> 00:15:04.330
It's to be expected that the Queen would understand that!

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:08.760
You're mistaken. Aldra intends to collect us here and turn us to stone.

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:13.800
But your real aim is to become my disciple because you yearn for my strength, isn't it?

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:15.150
It isn't!

00:15:15.150 --> 00:15:22.260
Turn your eyes towards my lovely{cute, sweet} battle and burn every little detail{every nook and corner, from head to toe etc..} into your mind!

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:27.030
Well then, I'll turn my irritation from being ignored all this time into motivation!

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:30.910
No one will be able to recognize you after I'm through! Prepare yourself!

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:33.700
Please listen when other people talk!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:46.710
I'm certain that this is the place.

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:49.050
However, this is...

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:52.600
It looks like you didn't get lost on your way here.

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:56.450
Shizuka-san!

00:15:57.800 --> 00:16:02.190
It seems that explaining it in a letter instead of using a map was the right decision.

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:05.950
Um, why did you call me out here?

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:10.420
Say, we've really come a long way, haven't we?

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:13.780
Escaping from the eyes of our pursuers...

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:15.710
Crossing the sea...

00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:18.700
We did well to make it this far.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:19.870
Really...

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:21.440
Yes.

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:25.570
That too is because you have always been at my side, Shizuka-san.

00:16:25.570 --> 00:16:26.990
So from the bottom of my heart, I-

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:27.770
Say...{hey?}

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:31.550
Why do you think I accompanied you until now?

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:37.620
O-Of course, to aid me in my mission to save Hinomoto.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.440
Shizuka-san?

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:46.790
You really are naïve, eh?

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:51.520
This was delivered to me{my place} earlier.

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:54.570
T-That is the Kouma group's...

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:58.540
It seems that the ways of assassins are already old-fashioned.

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:04.680
Since it's come to this, I guess the leader has to do everything in the end, after all.

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:07.170
Do you understand?

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:12.670
In other words, I'm the only assassin left to kill you, Tomoe-sama.

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:15.740
W-What are you saying?

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:19.950
M-Making a joke like that is in bad taste, Shizuka-san.{well I guess she stammeres something first like mou.. might want to make something else the first word, showing how perplexed she is before she can formulate the real sentence}

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:21.890
Hm? Like what?

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:25.670
Because if you had wanted to take away my life,

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:28.320
wouldn't you have had many opportunities already?

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:35.190
You don't know your own strength.

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:37.860
You're especially dangerous while bathing...

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:41.890
because you don't show any signs of being exposed in such situations.

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:46.290
So I became like grass.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:48.000
Grass?

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:52.750
Kouma Technique: Appearance of Friendship.

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:57.350
Deceiving an enemy to become "friends" with them, then striking at their weak point.

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:59.680
You understand{know}, don't you?

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:00.930
Then...

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:02.550
Then...

00:18:02.550 --> 00:18:06.540
Our friendship, which has been growing deeper up until now...

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:08.590
has all been a lie?

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:14.630
This technique turns your heart inside out.

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:19.080
If it's for Tomoe-sama's sake, then I don't need this life.{my}

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:21.600
I feel that way even now.

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:23.500
Then...{well then}

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:25.540
However, that alone isn't good enough.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.830
Why?!

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.950
That's because I'm...

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:31.540
a Kouma ninja!

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:45.770
Oh? You won't draw your sword?

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:48.350
Shizuka-san, please stop!

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:53.110
I cannot fight with you!

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:56.660
I can't speak my mind if things aren't like this!

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:58.160
You empathize with your opponents...

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:01.160
and that that is your weakness, Tomoe-sama!

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:09.300
Because of your abounding generosity, you are weak against those who are important to you.

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:12.260
Naïve.

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:14.680
You're too naïve!

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:20.910
And you're supposed to save Hinomoto like that? Don't make me laugh!

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:27.430
You've finally drawn it, eh?

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:32.350
If the fate of my country hangs in the balance...

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:36.270
That's right...

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:40.440
Tomoe-sama is boundlessly strong against her enemies.

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.060
But you know, Tomoe-sama...

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:48.470
you aren't only fighting your enemies in these battles.

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:53.910
You must risk your life in the battles to come.

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:59.600
I'll never forgive you if you fail the mission you were entrusted with.

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:03.310
That's why I had to do this.

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:11.790
That Kouma technique was a lie.

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:15.850
I never would have predicted...

00:20:17.970 --> 00:20:19.990
that I would come to love you so deeply.

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:26.910
Say, Tomoe-sama...

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:32.510
In your coming battles, fight as fiercely as you did now.

00:20:32.510 --> 00:20:33.210
Shizuka-san!

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:35.090
Don't cry.

00:20:35.090 --> 00:20:35.710
Yes...

00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:40.530
This is the only thing I have left for you to remember me by.

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:44.280
Shizuka-san.

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:45.370
Shizuka-san!

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:48.450
Shizuka-san...

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:57.130
You would never allow yourself to be defeated by me, Tomoe-sama.

00:20:57.960 --> 00:21:01.340
Since I believed that, I could challenge you to this fight.

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:08.200
I now return the life you gave me on that day.

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:12.870
In exchange for this life, I have killed off your weakness.

00:21:13.550 --> 00:21:16.470
You have a much greater purpose in life.

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:21.160
That was my reason for fighting you, so...

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:27.350
Because of that, I believe I was able to wield my sword as resolutely as you, Tomoe-sama.

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:28.070
Probably.

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:36.930
The sky will not fall, the sea will not dry, and the earth will not split.

00:21:36.930 --> 00:21:43.650
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:57.510
All life must come to an end.

00:21:57.510 --> 00:22:04.090
Assuming your time approaches.

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:10.730
Looking out over everything at the last moment.

00:22:10.730 --> 00:22:18.110
With no regrets, it seems like you're smiling.

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:22.580
These strong warriors are even stronger in their beauty

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:27.570
As they give it their all this day

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:31.940
In this showdown of skills.

00:22:31.940 --> 00:22:36.000
These strong warriors are even stronger

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:41.030
As they give it their all this day

00:22:41.030 --> 00:22:45.510
In this showdown of skills.

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:52.480
To gather the courage of thousands in this neverending dream...

00:22:52.480 --> 00:22:58.730
I am prepared to offer my life.

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:05.960
There is only one absolute truth.

00:23:14.630 --> 00:23:16.370
Hello, it's Melona!

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:19.720
Airi's really settled into her role as a babysitting character.

00:23:19.720 --> 00:23:23.380
She's completely lost sight of her objective, don't you think?

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:24.800
Well <i>excuse</i> me!

00:23:24.800 --> 00:23:28.070
Going off to fight in Queen's Blade and then back home to babysitting

00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:30.010
is weird, no matter how you look at it.

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:32.390
It looks like that useless angel is fighting this time as well, so...

00:23:32.390 --> 00:23:35.780
I guess we can't have two worthless
people in the same competition, can we?

00:23:35.780 --> 00:23:38.860
Next time: Shameful Shudder! Fighting Angel.

00:23:38.860 --> 00:23:43.400
I think it's about time for my comeback!
